{
 "id": "newton-vo-01",
 "words": true,
 "items": [
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_P_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[shocked, alarmed] 牛、牛顿先生！您拿针在干什么？！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[dry, irritated, not looking up] Don't move. You're in my light.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[alarmed, to the audience] 同声传译：大家千万别学！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold, firm] Not for publication.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[bright, warm, to the audience] 牛顿把阳光分成了七种颜色。今天，我们一种一种看。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_R_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[concerned] 牛顿先生，您的晚饭一口没动。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[genuinely surprised] Have I not eaten?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious, eager] 听说，您被苹果砸了头？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold, offended] It did not hit me.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[intense, fascinated] It fell. Why always straight down? Never sideways. Never up.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_O_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[lecturing, precise, proud] So white light is all the colours, mixed.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[puzzled] 今天没有学生？那您在跟谁讲？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[dry, deadpan] The walls. The walls never interrupt.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_Y_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[excited, out of breath] Newton! No one in London can answer this!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "300b35287e8acc21dd12bd610b831e19b47dc75e8b8c15c2bca80cdcb776ef2d",
      "voice_id": "yZ3w1DL4ZAxIdOscv2t8",
      "name": "Wilf"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[eager, fast] If the Sun pulls by the inverse square, what path does a planet take?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "300b35287e8acc21dd12bd610b831e19b47dc75e8b8c15c2bca80cdcb776ef2d",
      "voice_id": "yZ3w1DL4ZAxIdOscv2t8",
      "name": "Wilf"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[instantly, matter-of-fact] An ellipse.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[dry] I have calculated it.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[thrilled] Show me!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "300b35287e8acc21dd12bd610b831e19b47dc75e8b8c15c2bca80cdcb776ef2d",
      "voice_id": "yZ3w1DL4ZAxIdOscv2t8",
      "name": "Wilf"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[deadpan, a little embarrassed] I can't find it.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[disbelief, laughing, to the audience] 他算出了宇宙的规律，然后，弄丢了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[annoyed, firm] Not for publication.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cheerful, then sheepish] I'll publish it! But the Society is broke. They spent it on a book about fish.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "300b35287e8acc21dd12bd610b831e19b47dc75e8b8c15c2bca80cdcb776ef2d",
      "voice_id": "yZ3w1DL4ZAxIdOscv2t8",
      "name": "Wilf"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[baffled] 鱼？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_G_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[careful, nervous] 胡克先生说，平方反比是他先想到的。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[contemptuous, bitter] Hooke? That man claims every idea in England.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[smoothing it over, polite smile, to the audience] 牛顿先生说，胡克先生，很有想法。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[furious, shouting] Then I shall cut Book Three. He gets nothing!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious, teasing] 听说胡克的画像，是您毁掉的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[perfectly calm, deadpan] There is no evidence of that.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_B_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[curious] 听说莱布尼茨，也发明了微积分？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flat, cold] He stole it.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 那，谁来判断呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[smug] The Royal Society. A committee. Perfectly impartial.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 委员会是谁选的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[smug] The President.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious] 会长是？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[proud] Me.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[getting suspicious] 那调查报告，是谁写的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[pause, reluctant] Me.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious, teasing] 那夸报告的书评呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[blank, evasive] Anonymous.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[deadpan, to the audience] 也是他。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_I_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[startled] 牛顿先生？您怎么穿成这样？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[serious, focused] Hunting coiners.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[confused] 您不是科学家吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold, menacing] Tonight, I am the Mint.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[desperate, pleading, voice breaking] O dear Sir. Nobody can save me but you.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "3d1fa6a5595e0a31fff8d7c1a2f2794b91ca87ddd200066dfbdfcef662a65a1b",
      "voice_id": "1TE7ou3jyxHsyRehUuMB",
      "name": "EastendSteve"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold, menacing, leaning in] And you. Ever clipped a coin?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[scared, stammering] 没、没有！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[forced cheerful, nervous laugh, to the audience] 他问我，今天过得好不好。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_V_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[curious] 这个小本子，是您小时候的吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sharp, defensive] Put it down.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[reading slowly, uneasy] 威胁继父和母亲，要把他们连房子一起烧掉。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[careful, sympathetic] 您，为什么这么恨他们？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[weary, plain, honest] My father died before I was born. I was so small, I'd have fit in a quart mug.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[weary, plain, hurt underneath] At three, my mother remarried. And left me behind.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[moved, sympathetic] 那，后来呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[emotional, voice catching] Later, she fell ill. I sat up with her, whole nights. I dressed her blisters myself.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[composing himself, curt] Next question.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_W_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[moved, sincere] 他葬在威斯敏斯特教堂。为他抬棺的，是大法官、公爵和伯爵。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[satisfied, proud] That one may be published.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[surprised, delighted] 牛顿先生，您是不是笑了？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[stiff, embarrassed] I did not. Not for publication.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cheerful, cheeky, to the audience] 他说，欢迎点赞关注。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[laughing in pain] 哎哟！这次，真砸到头了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_P_s1642",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1642,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[shocked, alarmed] 牛、牛顿先生！您拿针在干什么？！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[dry, irritated, not looking up] Don't move. You're in my light.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[alarmed, to the audience] 同声传译：大家千万别学！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold, firm] Not for publication.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[bright, warm, to the audience] 牛顿把阳光分成了七种颜色。今天，我们一种一种看。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_R_s1642",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1642,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[concerned] 牛顿先生，您的晚饭一口没动。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[genuinely surprised] Have I not eaten?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious, eager] 听说，您被苹果砸了头？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold, offended] It did not hit me.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[intense, fascinated] It fell. Why always straight down? Never sideways. Never up.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_O_s1642",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1642,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[lecturing, precise, proud] So white light is all the colours, mixed.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[puzzled] 今天没有学生？那您在跟谁讲？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[dry, deadpan] The walls. The walls never interrupt.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_Y_s1642",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1642,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[excited, out of breath] Newton! No one in London can answer this!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "300b35287e8acc21dd12bd610b831e19b47dc75e8b8c15c2bca80cdcb776ef2d",
      "voice_id": "yZ3w1DL4ZAxIdOscv2t8",
      "name": "Wilf"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[eager, fast] If the Sun pulls by the inverse square, what path does a planet take?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "300b35287e8acc21dd12bd610b831e19b47dc75e8b8c15c2bca80cdcb776ef2d",
      "voice_id": "yZ3w1DL4ZAxIdOscv2t8",
      "name": "Wilf"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[instantly, matter-of-fact] An ellipse.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[dry] I have calculated it.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[thrilled] Show me!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "300b35287e8acc21dd12bd610b831e19b47dc75e8b8c15c2bca80cdcb776ef2d",
      "voice_id": "yZ3w1DL4ZAxIdOscv2t8",
      "name": "Wilf"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[deadpan, a little embarrassed] I can't find it.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[disbelief, laughing, to the audience] 他算出了宇宙的规律，然后，弄丢了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[annoyed, firm] Not for publication.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cheerful, then sheepish] I'll publish it! But the Society is broke. They spent it on a book about fish.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "300b35287e8acc21dd12bd610b831e19b47dc75e8b8c15c2bca80cdcb776ef2d",
      "voice_id": "yZ3w1DL4ZAxIdOscv2t8",
      "name": "Wilf"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[baffled] 鱼？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_G_s1642",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1642,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[careful, nervous] 胡克先生说，平方反比是他先想到的。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[contemptuous, bitter] Hooke? That man claims every idea in England.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[smoothing it over, polite smile, to the audience] 牛顿先生说，胡克先生，很有想法。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[furious, shouting] Then I shall cut Book Three. He gets nothing!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious, teasing] 听说胡克的画像，是您毁掉的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[perfectly calm, deadpan] There is no evidence of that.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_B_s1642",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1642,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[curious] 听说莱布尼茨，也发明了微积分？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flat, cold] He stole it.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 那，谁来判断呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[smug] The Royal Society. A committee. Perfectly impartial.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 委员会是谁选的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[smug] The President.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious] 会长是？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[proud] Me.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[getting suspicious] 那调查报告，是谁写的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[pause, reluctant] Me.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[suspicious, teasing] 那夸报告的书评呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[blank, evasive] Anonymous.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[deadpan, to the audience] 也是他。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_I_s1642",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1642,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[startled] 牛顿先生？您怎么穿成这样？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[serious, focused] Hunting coiners.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[confused] 您不是科学家吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold, menacing] Tonight, I am the Mint.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[desperate, pleading, voice breaking] O dear Sir. Nobody can save me but you.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "3d1fa6a5595e0a31fff8d7c1a2f2794b91ca87ddd200066dfbdfcef662a65a1b",
      "voice_id": "1TE7ou3jyxHsyRehUuMB",
      "name": "EastendSteve"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold, menacing, leaning in] And you. Ever clipped a coin?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[scared, stammering] 没、没有！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[forced cheerful, nervous laugh, to the audience] 他问我，今天过得好不好。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_V_s1642",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1642,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[curious] 这个小本子，是您小时候的吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sharp, defensive] Put it down.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[reading slowly, uneasy] 威胁继父和母亲，要把他们连房子一起烧掉。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[careful, sympathetic] 您，为什么这么恨他们？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[weary, plain, honest] My father died before I was born. I was so small, I'd have fit in a quart mug.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[weary, plain, hurt underneath] At three, my mother remarried. And left me behind.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
